      "statement": "The root Dockerfile builds the Facet base image FROM softinstigate/restheart:9.12.3, and examples/product-catalog/Dockerfile builds on top of the published softinstigate/facet:latest image (itself derived from 9.12.3), replacing the earlier RESTHeart 9.7.x base.",
