      "id": "claim_6b7b34353f0f46ce82c7b69a192183c4",
      "statement": "The GraalJS JS-plugin-loading bugs tracked in restheart#663, which affected RESTHeart 9.7.x, no longer need a snapshot/diagnostic image workaround: core/src/test/java/org/facet/integration/JsPluginsIT.java builds the facet-test:latest container from current sources and exercises the product-stats JS service and request-logger JS interceptor end-to-end (JSON response, HTML rendering, response headers, 401 on unauthenticated access) in CI on the 9.12.3 base.",
