    {
      "id": "claim_8d329a0a73ed4e1386805738ed294329",
      "statement": "The request-logger.mjs JavaScript interceptor (examples/product-catalog/plugins/request-logger/request-logger.mjs) registers a RESPONSE interceptPoint, uses resolve() to match only paths starting with /shop/, and adds X-Facet-Plugin, X-Request-Path, and X-Request-Method response headers using io.undertow.util.HttpString.tryFromString() keys rather than plain JavaScript strings, since Undertow's HeaderMap.add() requires an HttpString key.",
