    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f198552fc2c04608bc0ce17d30f9b4ab",
      "statement": "Both the quickstart configuration (etc/restheart.yml) and the product-catalog example configuration (examples/product-catalog/restheart.yml) disable /graphql, /mcpService, /bruteForceAttackGuard, /rndTokenManager, and /tokenBasicAuthMechanism by default, alongside enabling file-based ACL/auth and the Facet template/HTML interceptor plugins needed for JS-service-to-HTML pairing.",
